[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5040.99, "timestamp": "01:24:00", "text": "感覺到那種粗糙的口感，然後就吞下去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5043.03, "timestamp": "01:24:03", "text": "。你感覺到了。但是，每當我喝像斯米諾伏特加這樣的酒時，它的口感都非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5045.75, "timestamp": "01:24:05", "text": "順滑"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5046.165, "timestamp": "01:24:06", "author": "@sadclipy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/NWvAEsOJEb9XkxRRhbuJXnXDMWtc2foWGBwLbBuCxWYqdOpSmqfbtNXfVgmn1YExqB7uWppD9A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Hello"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5054.79, "timestamp": "01:24:14", "text": "。你感覺不到。感覺就像水流過喉嚨一樣。所以喝斯米諾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5059.35, "timestamp": "01:24:19", "text": "伏特加非常危險，因為它喝起來就像水一樣寡淡無味。  我還喝了點燒酒，但我其實"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5062.149, "timestamp": "01:24:22", "text": "不怎麼喝酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5066.229, "timestamp": "01:24:26", "text": "。對，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5068.229, "timestamp": "01:24:28", "text": "燒酒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5070.709, "timestamp": "01:24:30", "text": "燒酒就是不一樣。是的。你呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5077.91, "timestamp": "01:24:37", "text": "你最喜歡哪種燒酒？我從來沒喝過燒酒，所以我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5080.31, "timestamp": "01:24:40", "text": "我想，我想喝一次燒酒，嚐嚐它的味道。  或許我可以試試。不貴。我可以試試。這些罐頭並不貴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5087.27, "timestamp": "01:24:47", "text": "啊。哦，日本有很多好喝的燒酒。  是的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5089.03, "timestamp": "01:24:49", "text": "相信如果你去日本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5090.47, "timestamp": "01:24:50", "text": "，你一定會找到你喜歡的東西。但是話說回來，我和妻子也想去日本，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5092.07, "timestamp": "01:24:52", "text": "不是去那裡生活，因為我不會說日文。是的。坦白說，我很確定如果你去那裡"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5093.311, "timestamp": "01:24:53", "author": "@sadclipy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/NWvAEsOJEb9XkxRRhbuJXnXDMWtc2foWGBwLbBuCxWYqdOpSmqfbtNXfVgmn1YExqB7uWppD9A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I would rather drink coffee than alcohol. COFFEE is alcohol for me :>"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5098.629, "timestamp": "01:24:58", "text": "申請"}]